# This repo is edited from Windows but the pipeline scripts run on Ada
# (Linux). A CRLF shell script fails outright ("syntax error near
# unexpected token $'do\r'") the moment it's deployed there directly
# (scp) rather than reaching it through git, whose autocrlf normalization
# only fixes up the committed blob, not files copied straight off a
# Windows working tree. Force LF at checkout for anything that gets
# executed as a script on the cluster, regardless of the local
# core.autocrlf setting.
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.py  text eol=lf
